Thai Waters Rev F | reset_fast
* R14/C19 ESP_EN and R11/C8 LCD_RST nominal 10 kohm/100 nF; 9500 ohm, 80 nF.
* Model: Passive high transition after switch or expander release. Firmware LCD reset hold and bus boot are bench items.
Vdd src 0 DC 0 PULSE(0 3.3 1u 1n 1n 10m 20m)
Rpull src reset 9500
Creset reset 0 80n
.TRAN 5u 4m 0 5u
.PRINT TRAN V(reset)
.END
